 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">지원유형 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">반도체 및 방산분야</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"tab-stops:left blank 4.4pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;font-size:15.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">지원대상 및 규모</span></p><div style=\"text-align : left;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span><p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">신청자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, App